Hey! How's it going fellas? Waiting for amazing news? Cause we have one for ya!

We are glad to announce that the second act for Guns'N'Stories: Bulletproof is coming soon!

Yes, you heard it right. Act II is finished and we only need some time for voice acting. 

Speaking about what to expect from Act II:

1) exciting continuation of the story;
2) 3 completely new levels to play;
3) 3 new types of enemies;
4) 5 new weapons with unique gameplay;
5) breattaking sceneries;
6) lots of jokes from Bill;
7) new dangerous boss at the end.

So take a brewski, check your holsters and hop on our cart. Next station is C&J Fort!

